  "body": "Multi-day pending work, verified locally against live data. Net **−760 lines** (mostly retiring the Workout page).\n\n## Restructure\n- **Removed the Workout (`/today`) page** — logging moved onto Log.\n- **Log is now a picker**: `Strength ›` / `Cardio ›` → the logging sub-form with a **Back** button; the day-description prose stays in the Strength header.\n- **List + History merged** into one **History** tab with a **List / Calendar** toggle.\n\n## Account menu\n- Header avatar is now a **gravatar** (SHA-256 of the email) that opens a **click popup** — name · email · Sign Out · build hash.\n- Removed the decorative **`live` pill** (was hardcoded, never wired to data-source state).\n- Removed the **redundant hardcoded sidebar profile** (`nelsong6 · signed in · admin`) — the header is now the single account control ([NN/G utility-nav convention](https://www.nngroup.com/articles/utility-navigation/)).\n- Moved the **build hash** out of the header into the popup footer.\n\n## Dev / docs\n- `DEV_AUTH_EMAIL` → `nelson@romaine.life` (real account; gravatar re-keys to it).\n- `CLAUDE.md`: documented the headless-screenshot visual-verification method.\n\nProd build passes (`✓ 1.67s`). UI changes are frontend-only; the `vite.config.js` change is the dev-only `DEV_AUTH_EMAIL` default (inert in prod).\n",
